sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Author
    participant Page as Document Editor Page
    participant Server as Express Server
    participant Redis as Redis / BullMQ
    participant Worker as Puppeteer Worker
    participant DB as MongoDB

    User->>Page: Clicks 'Export PDF'
    Page->>Page: Set inline spinner state (disable button)
    Page->>Server: POST /api/export/pdf { documentId }
    Server->>DB: Fetch document HTML and Title
    DB-->>Server: Return document draft
    Server->>Redis: Enqueue export job: { html, title, orientation: A4 }
    Redis-->>Server: Job acknowledged (jobId: #102)
    Server->>Worker: Worker picks up job from queue
    Worker->>Worker: Launch headless browser & render editorial CSS
    Worker->>Worker: page.pdf({ format: 'A4', printBackground: true })
    Worker-->>Server: Return binary PDF Buffer
    Server-->>Page: Stream application/pdf blob
    Page->>User: Trigger automated browser download
    Page->>Page: Reset button state & show toast: 'PDF downloaded'
